--at the commencement of this Yuga, ब्रह्मा established the social polity of castes and orders; long life, learning, strength, beauty, health and righteousness were common; in course of time मोह made men irreligious and prejudiced; they appealed to Manu who created two sons, Priyavrata and उत्तानपाद through शतरूपा; they were the first kings of the earth; here was the division of the शम्हिता, Mantra, ऋषि and ब्राह्मण; the धर्म meant truth, जप, तपस् and दानम्; the kings were Cakravartins;
